on project for security operations available","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/evaluation-security.md","line":67},{"title":"Introduced views to the Platform Analytics workspace for Process Mining","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/analyst-workbench-dashboard.md","line":71},{"title":"Multidimensional maps are supported on the Opportunity details page and Platform Analytics components","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/opportunity-details.md","line":75},{"title":"Automated finding names updated","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/automated-findings.md","line":82},{"title":"Role names changed","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/components-installed.md","line":88},{"title":"Activating Process Mining","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/activating-process-mining.md","line":103},{"title":"Platform Analytics experience","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/par-workspace.md","line":107},{"title":"Task Mining","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/task-mining.md","line":111},{"title":"Platform Analytics release notes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/release-notes/analytics-intel-report-rn-landing.md","line":116}],"metadata":{"title":"Process Mining release notes","description":"The ServiceNow Process Mining application enables analysts and process owners to view their business processes, analyze them, and make decisions that improve their processes. Process Mining