.md","line":35},{"title":"New automated findings introduced","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/automated-findings.md","line":39},{"title":"Multidimensional projects filters","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/filter-project.md","line":47},{"title":"Evaluation project for security operations available","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/evaluation-security.md","line":51},{"title":"Introduced views to the Platform Analytics workspace for Process Mining","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/analyst-workbench-dashboard.md","line":55},{"title":"Multidimensional maps are supported on the Opportunity details page and Platform Analytics components","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/opportunity-details.md","line":59},{"title":"Automated finding names updated","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/automated-findings.md","line":66},{"title":"Role names changed","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/components-installed.md","line":72},{"title":"Activating Process Mining","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/activating-process-mining.md","line":87},{"title":"Platform Analytics experience","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/par-workspace.md","line":91},{"title":"Task Mining","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/task-mining.md","line":95},{"title":"Platform Analytics release notes","target":"ht